Reads of the *island's* key: none. SharedConversationPage writes it at :24 (the parameter), :74 (into
the page) and :107 (into the JSON) and never reads it; its script reads data.entries and data.report
and builds no links at all. The reads in the tree are of the *snapshot* field instead — web/app.js:1008
and ChatController.shareLink(for:):1392 — which is a different channel: it reaches both front ends
through the snapshot, not through the page's island.

